  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stimulating economic empowerment in the horticulture sector in the Northern Highlands of Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, the education provided by TVET (technical and vocational education and training) colleges, related to the horticulture sector in the Northern Highlands of Tanzania, will be upgraded to the level that they can produce graduates with the right set of knowledge, skills, and attitude to work for high-tech international horticulture companies. Changes will be made in:&#x2022;	The professional network between TVET colleges and the private sector in the Northern Highlands.&#x2022;	Skills of teaching staff and management teams of the TVET institutions.&#x2022;	Knowledge, skills, and business attitude of the TVET students and graduates.</narrative>
  </description>
